SUMMARY:Live Nation Presents Santiago Cruz
LOCATION:Arts at the Armory\, 191 Highland Ave\, Somerville\, MA 02143
DESCRIPTION:Santiago Cruz is one of the most important pop artists in Colom
 bia and Latin America. With more than 20 years of career\, the singer-song
 writer from Ibagué\, Tolima has become a key figure in the international 
 pop music scene\, earning multiple recognitions over the years. With 10 al
 bums released to date\, Santiago has received six Latin GRAMMY nominations
 . The “Sigo en Pie” Tour arrives alongside the release of his eleventh
  studio album\, “Fragmentos\,” which will feature 11 brand-new songs.\
 nhttps://artsatthearmory.org/events/live-nation-presents-santiago-cruz/\nF
