SUMMARY:Smut Slam
LOCATION:Arts at the Armory\, 191 Highland Ave\, Somerville\, MA 02143
DESCRIPTION:What's a SMUT SLAM? I'm so glad you asked! It's a fast-paced st
 orytelling open mic based on REAL life\, REAL lust\, REAL sex. Consenting 
 Slammers sign up on the night of to tell a 5-minute dirty story\, based on
  their real lives\, and a lucky 8-10 names will be drawn at random. A pane
 l of celebrity judges will be on hand to evaluate your stories\, and besto
 w the top three Slammers with a sack of sexy swag from Good Vibrations Har
 vard Square. You will also have the opportunity to win goodies from NJOY b
 y submitting your anonymous questions and confessions!\nhttps://artsatthea
 rmory.org/events/smut-slam-3-2026-08-04-2026-09-01-2026-10-06/\nFrom Pushp
